      "purpose": "`resilience` is the small composition foundation for the focused resilience libraries in `golib`. It provides deterministic generic policy composition, typed outcomes, caller-owned total deadlines, bounded observation, and one process-local work budget shared by retry and hedge. It does not hide a default policy stack or implement focused resilience algorithms.",
